    "detailed_description": "<h1>\u4e3a\u60a8\u63a8\u8350\u7684LSP\u65b0\u4f5c</h1><p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1>This is a story about a girl saving her sister. Her sister Mu Deng has contracted a terrible &quot;Dreamless Syndrome.&quot; The beautiful researcher &quot;ZZ&quot; resolutely pilots an experimental machine to carry out the &quot;Dream Break&quot; mission\u2014<br><br>Flying enemies continuously shoot bullets at you. You need to pilot the &quot;Dream Breaker&quot; to [graze bullets] and accumulate energy, then release the [Phantasm Skill] to clear the field at the right time. After clearing, the phantasm particles you collect can be used to upgrade your machine or change skins.<br><br>Scatter, Tunneling, Forcing, Reading... The backlash from memory projection causes her to mentally collapse. Who is the girl-shaped boss that appears deep in the dream?<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2242840/extras/d58db7e2ff868ef909e105610918e646.avif?t=1737807365\" /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2242840/extras/122a5bacd2df71de13d723c41498ea8f.poster.avif?t=1737807365\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2242840/extras/122a5bacd2df71de13d723c41498ea8f.webm?t=1737807365\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br>Step into the school life of the silent middle schooler &quot;Mu Deng,&quot; after encounters, bullying, and betrayal, what follows is despair, or perhaps...?<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2242840/extras/2635bfdf6bbca1814e940583cb152a2e.avif?t=1737807365\" /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2242840/extras/\u6155\u706f\u52a8\u6001\u56fe-EN.gif?t=1737807365\" /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2242840/extras/c866a7783a78d051e0094afe80bc2542.webp?t=1737807365\" /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2242840/extras/6a11624c812555967a8e33f0c4506eff.poster.avif?t=1737807365\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2242840/extras/6a11624c812555967a8e33f0c4506eff.webm?t=1737807365\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2242840/extras/6a11624c812555967a8e33f0c4506eff.mp4?t=1737807365\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2242840/extras/c866a7783a78d051e0094afe80bc2542.webp?t=1737807365\" /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2242840/extras/c61aacace899a510bf8dfc2e85901026.poster.avif?t=1737807365\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2242840/extras/c61aacace899a510bf8dfc2e85901026.webm?t=1737807365\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2242840/extras/c61aacace899a510bf8dfc2e85901026.mp4?t=1737807365\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>The game offers four playable characters. Players can choose &quot;Naoko&quot; with the [OT-A09], &quot;Mu Deng&quot; with the [OT-A09-MK2], the &quot;Plague Nun&quot; with the [OT-A10], or the mysterious &quot;Girl&quot; to infiltrate dreams and complete missions. Each machine has different bullet characteristics and skill styles.<br><br><strong>By the way, you can also change machine skins to fight in the fantasy image of female characters.</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2242840/extras/349707f778c83070ed01b990659fc400.avif?t=1737807365\" /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2242840/extras/ab693a746ef979bfbeab22d89de10add.poster.avif?t=1737807365\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2242840/extras/ab693a746ef979bfbeab22d89de10add.webm?t=1737807365\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2242840/extras/ab693a746ef979bfbeab22d89de10add.mp4?t=1737807365\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2242840/extras/c866a7783a78d051e0094afe80bc2542.webp?t=1737807365\" /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2242840/extras/d35000af60ed7b2662a60a7405bd7d19.poster.avif?t=1737807365\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2242840/extras/d35000af60ed7b2662a60a7405bd7d19.webm?t=1737807365\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2242840/extras/d35000af60ed7b2662a60a7405bd7d19.mp4?t=1737807365\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2242840/extras/370b38e3bf5d81dc18761a837c942bea.avif?t=1737807365\" /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2242840/extras/0abbc0696b9ef2c8232c548619ec5882.poster.avif?t=1737807365\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2242840/extras/0abbc0696b9ef2c8232c548619ec5882.webm?t=1737807365\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2242840/extras/0abbc0696b9ef2c8232c548619ec5882.mp4?t=1737807365\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2242840/extras/ae5f5eca26307ede37996707b13c27e5.webp?t=1737807365\" /></span><br><strong>Immersive story presentation\u2014</strong><br>Story stages use Live2D character animations, over 100 CGs, and animated effects. The unfolding truth reveals the heartwarming core beneath the cold surface.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2242840/extras/0eab8e626827717cf3b959f2fff08644.webp?t=1737807365\" /></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2242840/extras/774edda4856e3a523a5035b5703eb692.poster.avif?t=1737807365\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2242840/extras/774edda4856e3a523a5035b5703eb692.webm?t=1737807365\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2242840/extras/774edda4856e3a523a5035b5703eb692.mp4?t=1737807365\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2242840/extras/ae5f5eca26307ede37996707b1